### Lista serii (publiczne)
GET {{host}}/api/series
Accept: application/json

### Utworzenie serii – 201 + Location; id zapisywane w {{seriesId}}
POST {{host}}/api/series
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Temperatura – salon",
  "minValue": -10,
  "maxValue": 40,
  "color": "#1f77b4",
  "icon": "circle",
  "unit": "°C"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("seriesId", response.body.id);
%}

### Odczyt serii
GET {{host}}/api/series/{{seriesId}}
Accept: application/json

### Aktualizacja serii – 200
PUT {{host}}/api/series/{{seriesId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Temperatura – salon",
  "minValue": -15,
  "maxValue": 45,
  "color": "#ff7f0e",
  "icon": "triangle",
  "unit": "°C"
}

### Aktualizacja wykluczająca zapisane wyniki – 409 (gdy seria ma wyniki spoza [50, 60])
PUT {{host}}/api/series/{{seriesId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Temperatura – salon",
  "minValue": 50,
  "maxValue": 60,
  "color": "#1f77b4"
}

### min >= max – 422
POST {{host}}/api/series
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Zły przedział",
  "minValue": 10,
  "maxValue": 10,
  "color": "#1f77b4"
}

### Brak nazwy i zły kolor – 400 z errors[]
POST {{host}}/api/series
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "minValue": 0,
  "maxValue": 1,
  "color": "red"
}

### Uszkodzony JSON – 400
POST {{host}}/api/series
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"name":

### Accept: application/xml – 406
GET {{host}}/api/series
Accept: application/xml

### Nieistniejąca seria – 404 (Problem Details)
GET {{host}}/api/series/999999999
Accept: application/json

### Usunięcie serii – 204 (kasuje też czujniki i wyniki)
DELETE {{host}}/api/series/{{seriesId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
